Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:08.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.20,0:00:07.85,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Angels and demons were circling over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.85,0:00:13.55,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Crossing a brambly path of stars and milky ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.25,0:00:19.25,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}He who does not perceive his calling,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.06,0:00:25.65,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}does not know true happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:31.46,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:37.20,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.80,0:00:43.00,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Watch in awe! Watch in awe!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:48.40,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b0\i1}Flying in glory, Flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:01:00.76,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}I am calling, calling now. Spirits rise and falling.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.20,0:01:06.20,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}To be with you longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.50,0:01:12.52,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}Calling, calling...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.55,0:01:18.02,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}in the depth of longing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.50,0:01:24.00,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}To stay myself longer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.00,0:01:29.40,Default,,0,0,900,,{\b1\i1}The flow may swallow you, flying in glory
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.46,0:01:50.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So, they haven't found this place yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.71,0:02:05.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, I guess I'll wait until it's night time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.54,0:02:10.54,Default,,500,0,500,,{\b1\i1}Gunpowder Smoke\N and a \N Hail of Bullets{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.15,0:02:32.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm honoured that you remembered the Ministry of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.85,0:02:37.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In any case, this must be quite a predicament for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.35,0:02:39.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You have my sympathies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.25,0:02:41.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I don't have much time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.15,0:02:42.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so I'll be direct.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.25,0:02:48.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,While Section 9 has been officially dismantled, my subordinates are still evading capture.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.25,0:02:53.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wish to protect their personal safety; not Section 9's good name.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.85,0:02:57.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Can you persuade the Committee with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.80,0:03:09.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Even if I could, it would be impossible to placate the Prime Minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.90,0:03:12.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That is, not until the Lower House elections quiet down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.60,0:03:18.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,For now, protect Yakushima; after the elections, oust the Secretary General,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.70,0:03:20.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,give the media a scandal,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.80,0:03:24.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,and the people the illusion of social justice;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.80,0:03:28.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that would be the approximation of the Prime Minister's scenario.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.20,0:03:30.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,In exchange for my subordinates lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.40,0:03:34.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As long as you survive, the organisation can be rebuilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.10,0:03:38.10,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There is no need for you to commit double suicide with Section 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.80,0:03:40.60,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If I miss the current opportunity,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.70,0:03:44.20,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will never again be able to assemble such an exceptional team.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:49.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I cannot reconstruct Section 9 without them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:51.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please stop the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.77,0:03:57.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yakushima's influence is great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.87,0:04:01.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I am sure that building a case against Yakushima is a long-cherished goal for the prosecutors,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.67,0:04:05.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but in the end, the prosecutors only exist because of the State.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.07,0:04:07.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.67,0:04:09.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Would you like to take this back with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.87,0:04:12.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No. I will leave it with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.27,0:04:17.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Then why aren't you bowing and begging?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:22.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Doing so is only effective if one is in a superior position.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.07,0:04:24.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.27,0:04:27.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, you are quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.87,0:04:29.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Please don't take this personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.68,0:04:52.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wish I could hear more news about Section 9...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.18,0:04:55.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The war is getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.48,0:04:56.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.69,0:05:03.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yeah. So that's how things are, Gramps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.99,0:05:08.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The war is getting worse. You know the building that exploded yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.69,0:05:11.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was living there before I came here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.89,0:05:17.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This place is pretty comfortable, and I like you guys, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.59,0:05:21.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,but there is someone I want to help, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.93,0:05:26.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The war is getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.32,0:05:30.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Gramps, this is...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.82,0:05:33.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Thanks, Gramps!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.62,0:05:34.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm going!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.16,0:06:30.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Deciphering read code.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.86,0:06:34.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sixteen minutes until packeting of information is complete and dissemination can commence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.26,0:06:36.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.61,0:06:49.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.01,0:06:53.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Follow our orders and exit the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.53,0:07:04.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Colonel, we have completed the evacuation of civilians from the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.13,0:07:05.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.27,0:07:07.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Begin confiscating evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:08.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.81,0:07:16.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.71,0:07:18.01,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry about that, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.94,0:07:26.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What happened?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.54,0:07:27.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Give me a status report, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.29,0:07:30.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just a little payback.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.09,0:07:35.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You think you can keep us here without letting us evacuate?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.48,0:07:45.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You must be Ishikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.57,0:07:53.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,As soon as casualties are recovered,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.67,0:07:55.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,reorganize the team with the remaining members.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.67,0:07:57.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We will withdraw from the premises.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.57,0:08:00.07,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We won't find anything in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.97,0:08:03.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How unfortunate...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.37,0:08:07.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You will pay for my subordinates deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.63,0:08:13.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll make you pray for death before the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.23,0:08:17.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Colonel, the net at the safe house has caught some prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.73,0:08:19.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Is it the female leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.13,0:08:21.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No, it is the male gorilla with cybernetic eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.43,0:08:25.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Dispatch the reinforced exoskeleton units that were left on duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.73,0:08:26.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.32,0:08:34.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou-kun... you kept the natural oil!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.92,0:08:36.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:38.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Wait, why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.92,0:08:42.62,Default,,0,1200,750,,{\b1\i1}On Tachikoma's \N Eye: Matsukei Construction \N Arm: Safety First{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.02,0:08:42.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A rebel should act like one until the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.72,0:08:46.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I guess it means that we all share the same desires, despite our divergence.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.82,0:08:50.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We all have the same desire to save Batou-San!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.52,0:08:53.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Besides... that explosive shell you're holding...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.62,0:08:55.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You can't load that by yourself, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.62,0:08:56.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Nope...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.82,0:08:59.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But are we the only ones here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.72,0:09:03.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm the only one who survived out of the group that was sent to the labs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.72,0:09:07.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was left to rot after I was connected to some equipment for a final experiment,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.92,0:09:10.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,so I tore out the cord and ran away!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.02,0:09:16.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I myself was unable to stay put where I was, a high-altitude construction site.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.52,0:09:17.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:19.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,My story's about the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.92,0:09:22.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What happened to the lab group?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.62,0:09:25.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh yeah, they were all dismantled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.82,0:09:28.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Remember the one who was always reading books?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.82,0:09:33.12,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He got his brain picked apart the second we reached the labs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.52,0:09:36.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He seemed to actually be happy about that, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.32,0:09:37.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:42.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I guess everyone got to experience death, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.57,0:10:02.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I knew you'd do it, Major.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.57,0:10:04.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You're not one to skimp on the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.04,0:10:52.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.14,0:10:53.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Put the gun down!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.64,0:10:56.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.44,0:10:57.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.11,0:11:47.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.81,0:11:50.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I thought she'd be the type to hide them around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.53,0:12:12.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,He's finally down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.92,0:12:27.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Damn, I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.42,0:12:30.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:32.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do I look dead to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.63,0:12:38.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sorry. I stole your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.34,0:13:06.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Jesus Christ...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:08.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,There's more of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.44,0:13:28.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You caused unnecessary casualties...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.44,0:13:30.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To hell with taking him alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.54,0:13:32.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll take you back as a corpse!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.24,0:13:35.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But before that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.47,0:13:40.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is for the team members you killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.88,0:13:51.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And that one was for my partner you killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.08,0:14:04.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.87,0:14:06.87,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Get Batou-San to safety!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:08.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.23,0:14:13.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Sentient tanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.12,0:14:21.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm going first!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.11,0:14:26.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou-San, sorry for being late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.41,0:14:29.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We got held up trying to eavesdrop on the enemy's com systems.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.88,0:14:36.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll get him and come back, so please wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.68,0:14:38.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.46,0:14:45.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Where were they hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.26,0:14:49.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Do you think you can immobilize him somehow, with the wires?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:50.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'll try!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.35,0:14:56.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What are they trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.67,0:15:05.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.98,0:15:13.98,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why, you...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.30,0:15:29.90,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I must be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.00,0:15:32.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I only have one shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.05,0:15:45.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:46.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.25,0:15:47.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.22,0:15:52.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.64,0:16:00.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.94,0:16:04.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,So it was a dud...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.96,0:16:08.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I'm still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:21.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, God...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:26.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.28,0:16:28.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,powerless we are...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.98,0:16:30.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That isn't necessarily true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.88,0:16:39.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,What you have attained is anything but powerlessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.87,0:16:42.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That voice is...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.01,0:16:50.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is my last!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.14,0:16:58.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.74,0:16:59.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,O-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.73,0:17:04.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Batou-San...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.48,0:17:09.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Goodbye, Batou-San...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.72,0:17:28.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The second unit's response signal also disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:33.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's hard to believe, but were they both destroyed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.22,0:17:36.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I will make that decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.82,0:17:38.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,For now, all you have to do is get us to the site.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.63,0:17:49.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Why did these two...?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.53,0:17:55.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,They escaped from the labs because they wanted to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.21,0:17:58.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.43,0:18:08.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I had made up my mind that they were useless as weapons, since their AIs had evolved too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.63,0:18:15.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,However, as they proactively gathered information and repeatedly underwent synchronisation,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.23,0:18:20.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,they acquired individuality and the will to sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.03,0:18:25.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If only I had realised it sooner...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.13,0:18:31.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I could have confirmed whether or not they had gained ghosts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.03,0:18:33.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Ghost...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.21,0:18:36.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,If they weren't here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.41,0:18:39.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,you'd be dead by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.11,0:18:41.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.47,0:18:58.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,You can see Section 9 really well from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.17,0:19:02.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,To think that you'd have a safe house here, of all places...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.25,0:19:06.25,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.55,0:19:20.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It doesn't feel right unless I'm in this body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.96,0:19:27.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It was being remotely controlled, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.63,0:19:31.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.88,0:19:57.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.08,0:20:00.78,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I was about to miss getting this to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.35,0:20:04.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.05,0:20:07.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,No matter how many times you switch bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.55,0:20:11.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that watch has been keeping your elapsed lifetime for each one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.90,0:20:15.40,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The flow of time that passes us by...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.70,0:20:20.50,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It is because people wish to record proof that defines their individuality, their ego,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.60,0:20:23.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,that they entrust it to external mnemonic devises.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.40,0:20:32.00,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Isn't that thing the only thing that can define who you are - your external mnemonic device?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.96,0:20:38.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When did you get so serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.83,0:20:43.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,A watch and bodybuilding...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.93,0:20:48.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,we both have been clinging to pointless fragments of our memory, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.48,0:20:55.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,We are most likely the only Section 9 members who have not been captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.18,0:21:01.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Let's keep going and preserve a record of what we were trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.08,0:21:05.58,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Well, it's not as if I can die in peace without having met my goals.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.05,0:21:33.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Primary sniping target : Kusanagi Motoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.45,0:21:37.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,The committee has issued an order for her elimination.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.75,0:21:39.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,This is our only chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.45,0:21:42.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Shoot the moment they start boarding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.89,0:22:14.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Motoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.52,0:22:28.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Motoko!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.92,0:22:30.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Motoko!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.62,0:22:39.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Vital signs: negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.32,0:22:41.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Destruction of target, confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.15,0:22:46.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Dammit...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.76,0:22:55.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Motoko!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.76,0:23:19.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's so cold and human
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.66,0:23:23.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,It's something humans do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.64,0:23:27.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She stays so cold in her soul, she's so number 9
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.96,0:23:30.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She's incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.94,0:23:35.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Just incredible math
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.41,0:23:39.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,And is she really human?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.83,0:23:42.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She says there's something new
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.70,0:23:47.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,But wake a lithium flower, just about to bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.85,0:23:50.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I smell lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.55,0:23:55.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,Smelling lithium now
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.95,0:24:00.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.15,0:24:00.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.85,0:24:03.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How... is she what she doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.25,0:24:05.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,She doesn't say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.81,0:24:07.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,How is she when she doesn't suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.81,0:24:10.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,I wonder what she does when she wakes up
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.32,0:24:14.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,100,,When she wakes up
